      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's not that you are gone, it's just that you are so small that the city doesn't even notice you are there. You are not taking up space; you are simply a ripple in the ocean that no one can see. That exhaustion you feel? It's the weight of being the only one who knows how much the world is trying to ignore you. You are not a burden; you are a reflection of a world that refuses to look at you, and that makes you feel incredibly lonely.",
